` Style property offsets are stored in U64 masks
_ style-mask-cap Size = 64
_ next-style-store-id U32

` Registry of all registered Style types, indexed by style-index
_ style-infos [StyleInfo]

` Registry of declared invalidation domains. Domains are library-defined: the compiler interns
` every name appearing in a `-> domain` annotation or a $is-<domain>-invalid accessor and mirrors
` the (name, index) pairs here through style registrations, so roots can query pending state by
` name without any domain being known to the compiler itself.
_ style-domain-names [String]

` Registry of interned object style values (layout/painter descriptors). Encoded I64 handles are
` append-only 1-based slots so a reclaimed handle can never alias a later value. The registry is
` weak: authored declarations and live owner side payloads provide dynamic ownership, while
` compiler-interned static values are retained separately for the lifetime of the program.
_ style-object-holders [Weak'StyleObjectHolder]
_ style-permanent-object-holders [StyleObjectHolder]

` Cached packed bits for static rule expressions, indexed by compiler-assigned site. A rule's
` object value (`layout = flex-col`) is evaluated once and shared by every application.
_ style-static-site-bits [I64]
_ style-projection-remaps [StyleProjectionRemap]
_ style-projection-remap-registered [Bool]
_ style-projection-remap-registration-attempts Size = 0

` Shared authored declaration templates, indexed by compiler-assigned markup construction site.
` Static declarations live here once per site; mounted node records point at the template instead
` of copying those declarations on every mount.
