+ do style-provide-style-sheet
    - object-pointer CPointer'Void
    - record StyleSheetRecord

` Installs (or replaces) a provided style-sheet on a mounted node, changing the effective
` style-sheet of that style-sheet kind for the node and its mounted subtree.

. attachment = style-live-attachment(object-pointer)
?! StyleSheetPanic("Cannot provide a style-sheet on an unmounted object")
    if !attachment

. live = attachment
. store = style-attachment-store(live)
. node-record = style-ensure-node-record(live)

. provided = node-record.provided-style-sheets
if !provided
    node-record.provided-style-sheets = List'StyleSheetRecord()
    provided = node-record.provided-style-sheets

. sheets = provided!
. index Index = 0
while index < sheets.length
    . existing = sheets[index]
    if existing.info == record.info
        =? if existing == record
        existing.providers -= live.owner-address
        sheets[index] = record
        record.providers += live.owner-address
        style-mark-style-sheet-provider(store, live)
        =
    index += 1

sheets += record
record.providers += live.owner-address
style-mark-style-sheet-provider(store, live)

