_ StyleSheetChange

` How a theme tag turned on or off changes a family's active member in a subtree: the member
` before and after, which slots hold other values, and whether any does.

+ info StyleSheetInfo
+ before StyleSheetRecord
+ after StyleSheetRecord
+ slots [Bool]
+ differs = false

────────────────────
+ This
    - info
    - before
    - after

. offset Size = 0
while offset < info.slot-count
    . changed = bits-differ || before.value-none(offset) != after.value-none(offset)
        .. bits-differ = before.value-bits(offset) != after.value-bits(offset)
    slots += changed
    differs = differs || changed
    offset += 1

